; leftmost. Bits 12-14 are zero in all 3840 rows of all four sets. Bit 15 is not
; ink: it is a per-glyph flag, uniform across all ten rows of a glyph in every
; case.
;
; WHAT BIT 15 MEANS. The firmware reads it, at $A69B:
;
;     LDX glyphPtr
